            "review_title": "Review at Texas Chicken",
            "review_text": "John W\nSydney, Australia40 contributions\n0\nGreat Chicken that beats other competitors hands down\nJul 2016 • Family\nWe visited this new upmarket Chicken House for a snack and loved it. The chicken was spicy or regular and we tried both kinds. We believe that the chickens are not frozen but extremely fresh. The crispy batter is yummy and we licked our fingers for more. The spicy version was my favorite. \nThe decor is upmarket and looks a winner. Service is great and we saw lots of age groups dining.\nInterestingly enough I was in Iraq last year and when going for a stroll one night we stumbled upon a Texas Chicken outlet. I convinced my colleagues to have a snack...thumbs up was the verdict.\nGood to see a wholesome restaurant that caters for all here in Vietnam..hope to see more when we return.\nRead more\nWritten July 3, 2016",
