            "review_text": "Diana N\n101 contributions\n0\nMediocre Fried Chicken\nMay 2015 • Friends\nMy friends and I decided to come here out of pure curiosity.\n\nNow in America I would rate the popular fast food fried chicken restaurants as \n#1. Popeyes\n#2 KFC (only the original recipe)\n#3 Bojangles/Church's chicken\n#4 Any other fast food fried chicken place is probably not worth going to.\n\nTexas Chicken tasted like Bojangles/Church's chicken. Good if you're really craving some fried chicken but not the best. I wouldn't recommend this place since there are Popeyes and KFCs that do exist in Ho Chi Minh city!\nRead more\nWritten March 21, 2016",
